WEBVTT

00:00:06.690 --> 00:00:10.690
Yuma... Yuma!

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:22.220
The... The results of the vote...

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:23.710
And the next Class Rep has been...

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:27.170
...decided as Yuma Tsukumo-<i>kun</i>!

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:30.710
Yuma!

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:32.970
It's decided!

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:33.850
What is...?

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:36.510
Look! Yuma, you've been made Class Rep!

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:39.540
Me?!

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:43.800
It's for the best, so I nominated you, Yuma-<i>kun</i>.

00:00:43.810 --> 00:00:46.770
Shingetsu, that really is too much.

00:00:46.770 --> 00:00:49.520
I never thought you'd actually get elected!

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:51.250
Yeah, what a shocker!

00:00:51.480 --> 00:00:52.970
You guys...

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:53.770
<i>Cat.</i>

00:00:53.770 --> 00:00:56.320
My vote of love worked.

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.200
Hey, Class Rep Yuma!

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:00.370
We're relying on you, Class Rep Yuma.

00:01:00.370 --> 00:01:02.290
Class Rep Yuma, all the best!

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:04.500
<i>Good luck! We're counting on you!</i>

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:07.770
You mean you're counting on <i>me</i>?!

00:01:08.650 --> 00:01:13.710
Yuma, I am not sure that you have the qualities necessary to lead a group...

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:18.930
Yes! That means it's fine to be late and eat lunch early!

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:21.760
And to Duel during study period!

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:28.150
<i>I-If I am no longer the Class Rep, then what exactly...?</i>

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:41.620
<i>Yuma Tsukumo.</i>

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:46.000
<i>He's late all the time and eats his lunch before schedule.</i>

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:48.710
<i>He talks to himself strangely.</i>

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:53.710
<i>The guy who has the least bit 
of responsibility became Class Rep?!</i>

00:01:54.550 --> 00:01:55.380
Impossible!

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:57.710
Right, that's impossible!

00:01:58.480 --> 00:02:00.140
Gilag-<i>sama</i>!

00:02:00.140 --> 00:02:01.800
Right, Student Council!

00:02:01.800 --> 00:02:07.600
What do you mean you guys couldn't come up with any ideas after putting your heads together?

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:08.770
Well...

00:02:08.770 --> 00:02:14.270
So how about it? Do you have a plan
 to crush Yuma Tsukumo or not?!

00:02:14.270 --> 00:02:17.570
I have one! Right here!

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:23.110
<i>I have been serving under the Student Council as Chairman for exactly two years, three months, and eleven days.</i>

00:02:23.110 --> 00:02:27.080
<i>I, Marmoru Jinguuji, who they call the king of all Student Council Chairmans...</i>

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:31.580
Gilag-<i>sama</i>, I'll make sure to use the card you gave me...

00:02:31.750 --> 00:02:34.000
I'm expecting a lot from you!

00:02:34.850 --> 00:02:37.970
For the sake of Barian World!

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:42.490
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:02:42.490 --> 00:02:48.460
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:51.170
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:03:00.970 --> 00:03:03.520
<i>Preparations for the fight are ready</i>

00:03:03.520 --> 00:03:06.600
<i>I can already hear the shivering of my heart</i>

00:03:06.770 --> 00:03:11.110
<i>Been waiting this whole time</i>

00:03:11.110 --> 00:03:13.480
<i>I may meet with defeat...</i>

00:03:13.690 --> 00:03:16.700
<i>But that's exactly why I have to stand back up</i>

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:21.240
<i>Need to get stronger again</i>

00:03:21.410 --> 00:03:23.370
<i>It's good to believe</i>

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:26.080
<i>The "now", more than ever before, is</i>

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:28.540
<i>but another limit to break down</i>

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:31.590
<i>I can cross with ease</i>

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:34.050
<i>It's just beginning now</i>

00:03:34.050 --> 00:03:40.090
<i>This story continues to be etched into my heart endlessly</i>

00:03:40.090 --> 00:03:42.850
<i>These feelings... burning up inside!</i>

00:03:42.890 --> 00:03:44.310
<i>Right here in my hand,</i>

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:49.020
<i>I'm holding a powerful trump card.</i>

00:03:49.140 --> 00:03:58.070
<i>With an unbreakable heart, I face toward my dream!</i>

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:14.440
The Special Disciplinary Commander reporting to the Student Council?!

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:16.940
Right. Will you accept?

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:21.360
<i>"Dueling Is Against School Rules!? 
Sally Forth! The Special Disciplinary Commander!"</i>

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:22.400
Your ability as a Class Rep to keep order of in your class was incredible.

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:26.320
The Student Council Chairman actually recognized me!

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:28.120
To summarize, I am thrilled!

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:32.000
I am confident that you will definitely get this job done.

00:04:32.830 --> 00:04:33.460
What do you think?

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:35.630
Yes! I'd be glad to!

00:04:40.090 --> 00:04:40.960
Ta-da!

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:43.930
So... What exactly <i>is</i> it, or not?

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:46.300
It's the Numbers Club Membership Card!

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:49.720
Huh?! Tetsuo-<i>kun</i>, did you actually make it?!

00:04:50.470 --> 00:04:52.930
Well, yeah. I got one for all of you.

00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:55.100
Got one, or not!

00:04:55.100 --> 00:04:56.440
Cat's so thrilled!

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:59.110
Oh? Tetsuo-<i>kun</i>, I would want one too!

00:04:59.110 --> 00:05:02.070
Please let me join the Numbers Club, too!

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:05.780
S-Sure... Well, I'll make you a membership card later, so...

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:15.620
C-Class Rep?!

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:18.420
D-Don't scare me like that!

00:05:18.420 --> 00:05:19.840
What's with that outfit?

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:22.460
I am not the Class Representative anymore!

00:05:22.760 --> 00:05:26.090
I am the Special Disciplinary Commander, directly reporting to the Student Council!

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:28.180
Special Disciplinary...?

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:30.050
Command-a-what?

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:31.060
What's that meow-n?

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:35.270
As the Special Disciplinary Commander, I have to check for any students violating school rules.

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:38.770
As such, I am given authority to add points to any offenders.

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:42.280
Tetsuo-<i>kun</i>, you brought unwanted items to school...

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:44.110
You get one violation point!

00:05:45.030 --> 00:05:47.990
By the way, accumulating 10 violation points will result in school suspension!

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:51.950
With 30 points... you will get expelled!

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:03.880
Oh, really? That really happened?

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:05.840
Cat!

00:06:06.170 --> 00:06:08.630
Conversing with cats is banned on campus!

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:10.850
S-Say wh-eow?!

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:13.220
So back in class before...

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:21.480
Mini skirts are banned!

00:06:21.480 --> 00:06:22.940
It's the <i>uniform</i>!

00:06:24.860 --> 00:06:26.530
Naughty kids are banned!

00:06:26.530 --> 00:06:28.780
But I didn't do anything yet, or not!

00:06:28.780 --> 00:06:30.700
Ah, bad, I'm late-

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:31.870
Being late is banned!

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:35.410
Lunch in class is banned!

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:37.370
Diving is banned!

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:39.790
Open flies are banned!

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:42.340
Ditching cleaning duty is banned!

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:44.050
Banned.

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:48.130
The violation of school rules is banned!

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:52.720
What the heck are you up to?!

00:06:53.720 --> 00:06:56.020
What do you mean to imply?

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:58.940
Everything I do violates the rules! Gimme a break!

00:06:58.940 --> 00:07:01.900
It's because you broke the school rules, Yuma-<i>kun</i>.

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:04.190
Even so, this is going too far!

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:05.900
It's not going too far.

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:12.110
What permits you in the first place to complain about the Special Disciplinary Commander?

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:14.080
What permits me...?

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:16.240
Be-Because I'm the Class Rep!

00:07:16.240 --> 00:07:18.040
Yuma Tsukumo-<i>kun</i>.

00:07:19.660 --> 00:07:21.120
The Student Council Chairman!

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:24.750
It would appear that you object
 to the policy of the Student Council.

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:26.090
Right!

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:32.510
In that case, why not settle this in your forte--a Duel?

00:07:32.510 --> 00:07:36.970
If you win, the Special Disciplinary Commander will be abolished.

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:40.020
Really? Let's start immediately!

00:07:40.020 --> 00:07:45.480
However...! Even more than in school, the school rules have to be followed in this Duel as well.

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:46.400
Understand?

00:07:46.940 --> 00:07:47.820
Sure!

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:54.780
Then, Special Disciplinary Commander, please will check for violations of the school rules during this Duel.

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:55.830
Yes.

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:57.120
Let's go!

00:08:00.910 --> 00:08:02.620
Duel Disk, set!

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:07.290
D-Gazer, set!

00:08:11.720 --> 00:08:14.340
<i>AR-Vision: Link established.</i>

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:15.760
Duel!!

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:19.180
I'll go first. My turn, draw!

00:08:19.890 --> 00:08:22.560
From my hand, I Summon Gagaga Magician!

00:08:24.650 --> 00:08:26.520
I'm relying on you, Gagaga Magi-

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:30.030
A violation! A school rule violation!

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:31.990
Huh?! A school rule violation?!

00:08:32.280 --> 00:08:33.490
It's outfit is too long!

00:08:33.740 --> 00:08:34.950
Flashy accessories!

00:08:35.660 --> 00:08:36.910
Carrying weapons!

00:08:38.330 --> 00:08:40.950
Thi... This is a serious violation of all school rules!

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:45.670
Then, what would the Special Disciplinary Commander deem a proper reprimand?

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:47.590
One week suspension from school!

00:08:47.590 --> 00:08:50.760
To summarize, it goes back to the hand!

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:54.550
Wha... What do you mean?!

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:59.010
Didn't I tell you? Even when Dueling,
 I strictly follow the school rules.

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:03.430
In other words, Monsters that violate the school rules cannot be Summoned.

00:09:03.850 --> 00:09:04.850
No way...

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:08.270
This is what you get for carelessly accepting a dubious Duel.

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:10.020
It couldn't be helped!

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:13.990
I'll set one card and end my turn!

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:24.910
My turn, draw!

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:30.250
I activate the Continuous Magic,
 Mirror Stage of Order, from my hand.

00:09:31.340 --> 00:09:37.970
Once this Magic is activated, all Monsters on my field keep their original Attack and Defense Powers.

00:09:39.010 --> 00:09:41.640
Then I Summon Tamagushi, the Exemplary Priestess!

00:09:48.810 --> 00:09:52.530
Hey, how'd you suddenly Summon a Level Six?

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:59.910
It can be Summoned without release. Then its Attack Power becomes zero.

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:01.620
Seriously?

00:10:03.160 --> 00:10:06.960
Hey, class rep! That skirt should violate the school rules!

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:08.790
You not checking on that?

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:13.460
With the effect of the Continuous Magic, Mirror Stage of Order,

00:10:13.840 --> 00:10:17.930
all Monsters on my field will keep their original Attack Power.

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:18.970
Yes.

00:10:19.390 --> 00:10:20.890
Any problems now?

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:22.510
No, no problems!

00:10:24.390 --> 00:10:25.060
Wha-

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:27.270
You could say all this is well calculated.

00:10:27.560 --> 00:10:31.270
Then I Special Summon Sakaki the Honor Student Priest.

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:37.530
This Monster can be Special Summoned when I have a Monster with Priestess in its name on my field.

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:39.740
He's got two Level Sixes now...

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:41.320
Yuma, watch out!

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:46.870
I Overlay my Level Six Tamagushi, the Exemplary Priestess and Sakaki, the Honor-Student Priest!

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:51.080
I build the Overlay Network with these two Monsters!

00:10:51.420 --> 00:10:53.000
Xyz Summon!

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:58.920
Protector of the rules, descend! Norito, the Disciplinary Chief Priest!

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:01.430
Go, Norito, the Disciplinary Chief Priest!

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:03.970
Direct attack on Yuma Tsukumo!

00:11:06.470 --> 00:11:08.890
Trap, activate! Impenetrable Attack!

00:11:09.640 --> 00:11:11.980
Using this, I take zero damage!

00:11:12.520 --> 00:11:17.480
Winning by cheating is forbidden! The effect of Norito, the Disciplinary Chief Priest activates!

00:11:17.990 --> 00:11:22.990
I can detach one Overlay Unit to negate and destroy one Spell or Trap of the opponent!

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:28.120
Now, go! Norito!

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:40.050
I set one card and end my turn.

00:11:42.220 --> 00:11:44.970
My turn, draw!

00:11:45.350 --> 00:11:49.560
Yuma, it is useless to Summon Monsters that don't comply with school regulations.

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:52.390
You can talk...

00:11:53.100 --> 00:11:56.440
Right! Even if the school rules will be violated, I found a way around it!

00:11:57.320 --> 00:12:00.240
I set a Monster in Face-Down Defense Position!

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:04.450
How's that?! Now you won't know
 if it violates the school rules or not!

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:10.200
Did the experience of having broken so many school rules help here?

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:14.380
Trap, activate! Spot Check!

00:12:15.040 --> 00:12:20.590
With this card, a Face-Down Defense Position Monster on the field is changed to Face-Up Defense Mode.

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:26.300
Darn it! it's Gagaga Girl!

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:33.810
A violation! A violation of school rules!

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:36.900
The skirt is too short.

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:39.650
Creepy accessories.

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:43.070
Wearing of a uniform with too much exposure!

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:47.280
Plus the outrageous blond hair!

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:51.660
That's an assembly of school rule violations...

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:53.500
Of course, this means suspension!

00:12:53.790 --> 00:12:57.290
To summarize, back to the hand, if you please!

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:00.920
Not yet! Quick-Play Magic! Clear Robe, activate!

00:13:01.380 --> 00:13:05.010
With this card, if one Monster would be removed from my field,

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:09.430
its Attack and Defense Points change
 to zero and it stays on the field!

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:13.350
How's that?!

00:13:13.560 --> 00:13:17.940
If the outfit can't be seen with the effect of Clear Robe, school rules will not be violated.

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:19.110
But...

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:22.150
I told you, cheating is not allowed!
 Haven't you understood that yet?!

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:24.360
The Monster Effect of Norito activates!

00:13:24.570 --> 00:13:30.080
By detaching one Overlay Unit, one Magic or Trap is negated and it is destroyed!

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:35.870
Therefore, Gagaga Girl returns to the hand!

00:13:38.330 --> 00:13:40.210
Gagaga Girl!

00:13:40.750 --> 00:13:42.460
Master!

00:13:44.300 --> 00:13:47.550
Darn it all! If this keeps up...

00:13:47.970 --> 00:13:50.930
Calm down, Yuma. Use Tatakawa Knight.

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:55.480
I activate Tatakawa Knight's effect from my hand!

00:13:56.810 --> 00:14:01.190
When there are only Monsters on the opponent's field and one of my Trap or Magic Cards is negated,

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:06.320
I can send this card to the Graveyard to inflict 1500 points of damage to the opponent!

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:13.410
Okay, Yuma! Now the counter attack starts!

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:18.920
Guys who try to force their own rules need to be set right!

00:14:20.750 --> 00:14:24.420
With the Magic Card, Resurrection of the Dead, I'll revive Tamagushi, the Exemplary Priestess from my opponent's Graveyard,

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:26.880
and Special Summon her in Defense Position!

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:29.430
My Monster is...

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:32.890
Right! This is originally your Monster.

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:35.680
You can't catch me with the school rules now, right?

00:14:37.520 --> 00:14:39.810
I set one card and end my turn!

00:14:41.060 --> 00:14:43.070
Unforgivable... Unforgivable.

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:45.280
Unforgivable!

00:14:45.940 --> 00:14:47.440
Special Disciplinary Commander!

00:14:47.820 --> 00:14:51.070
That attack on the player undoubtedly is an act of school violence!

00:14:51.410 --> 00:14:52.780
Therefore, it's negated!

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:54.120
Bu... but...

00:14:54.160 --> 00:14:58.370
The direct attack with Norito, the Disciplinary Chief Priest hasn't been a problem at all...

00:14:58.370 --> 00:15:02.080
It doesn't matter! To boot, this guy is someone who is stealing!

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:04.380
This is a serious violation of the school rules!

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:07.010
Yuma Tsukumo has to be expelled immediately!

00:15:07.300 --> 00:15:09.550
However you look at it, it's unreasonable...

00:15:09.590 --> 00:15:11.090
That's right, it is unreasonable!

00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:15.430
Just why are you helping a guy like that?

00:15:15.720 --> 00:15:17.890
Why would you be something like
 a Special Disciplinary Commander?

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:22.810
Because... it couldn't be helped.

00:15:23.060 --> 00:15:27.360
I'm not the Class Rep anymore, so I had to become something else!

00:15:28.190 --> 00:15:33.240
I mean, if I'm not the Class Rep anymore,
 how should I be addressed?

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:36.740
It doesn't matter what people call you!

00:15:36.990 --> 00:15:42.040
Just because they're not calling you Class Rep anymore doesn't mean you can't be one!

00:15:43.500 --> 00:15:44.420
<i>Right...</i>

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:47.670
<i>I wanted to help everyone, even if it was just a little bit.</i>

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:51.840
<i>I wanted to have a good class, so I wanted to be Class Rep...</i>

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:56.470
I... I...

00:15:58.270 --> 00:16:00.430
Press forward on the path you believe in!

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:02.190
That's how you bring it to 'em!

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:05.060
Show me how you bring it to 'em!

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:09.860
How I... bring it to 'em?

00:16:11.900 --> 00:16:14.070
Yuma-<i>kun</i>, please have a look.

00:16:14.240 --> 00:16:15.740
This is Takashi Todoroki's...

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:18.790
Todoroin' it to 'em!

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:19.910
Wha-?

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:21.080
Alright!

00:16:23.830 --> 00:16:26.710
School rules don't apply for this Duel anymore!

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:31.050
Yuma-<i>kun</i>, to summarize, do your best against that guy!

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:31.670
Sure!

00:16:33.300 --> 00:16:35.680
<i>All of them are against me...</i>

00:16:36.220 --> 00:16:38.350
My turn, draw!

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:46.060
I activate the Rank-Up Magic, Barian's Force, from my hand!

00:16:46.900 --> 00:16:47.560
He's...!

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:48.440
Barian!

00:16:48.820 --> 00:16:52.650
This card will Rank-Up my Xyz Monster,

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:54.990
and Special Summons a Chaos Xyz!

00:16:55.610 --> 00:16:59.660
I rebuild the Overlay Network with
 Norito, the Disciplinary Chief Priest!

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:02.120
Chaos Xyz Change!

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:10.210
Appear before us, Chaos Xyz -
Saimon, the Disciplinary High Priest!

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:16.300
Here I go! Saimon's Monster Effect activates!

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:19.470
By detaching one Chaos Overlay Unit,

00:17:19.470 --> 00:17:22.680
I can change the position of one opposing Monster!

00:17:24.980 --> 00:17:26.140
Here it comes, Yuma!

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:27.100
Right!

00:17:27.440 --> 00:17:28.810
This is the finishing blow!

00:17:29.060 --> 00:17:32.940
Saimon, the Disciplinary High Priest, attack Tamagushi, the Exemplary Priestess!

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:42.200
Understand the power of a Chaos Xyz yet?

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:47.290
Phew, that was a close call.

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:49.590
Before I received the attack,

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:52.840
I used the Trap Card, Half Unbreak.

00:17:53.460 --> 00:17:55.220
With the effect of Half Unbreak

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:59.970
one Monster that was attacked cannot be destroyed by battle this turn.

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:04.850
And Battle Damage to that player is halved.

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:06.520
What an impudent trick...!

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:09.940
I activate the Quick-Play Magic, Double Check!

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:15.570
It destroys a Monster that can't
 be destroyed by battle this turn.

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:18.450
Though he managed to stand up,

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:21.120
Yuma-<i>kun</i> now has just 300 Life.

00:18:21.530 --> 00:18:23.700
However you look at it, if it goes on like that...

00:18:24.700 --> 00:18:26.750
Don't worry, Class Rep!

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:30.290
Now it's my turn to show you how I bring it to 'em!

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:32.460
My turn! Draw!

00:18:33.460 --> 00:18:34.210
Got it!

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:35.670
Go, Yuma!

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:36.630
Right!

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:39.260
I Summon Gagaga Magician!

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:47.810
Then I activate the Magic Card, Gagaga Wind!

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:52.810
It increases the level of one Gagaga Monster in my hand by one,

00:18:52.810 --> 00:18:54.270
then I Special Summon it!

00:18:54.690 --> 00:18:57.240
Gagaga Girl is cleared from school suspension!

00:18:57.650 --> 00:19:01.910
I Overlay the Level Four Gagaga Girl and Gagaga Magician!

00:19:04.370 --> 00:19:07.580
I build the Overlay Network with these two Monsters!

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:09.580
Xyz Summon!

00:19:10.790 --> 00:19:15.130
Come forth, Number 39, Aspiring Emperor - Hope!

00:19:18.550 --> 00:19:21.430
You want to beat a Chaos Xyz with something like that?

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:26.600
Gagaga Girl's Monster Effect activates!

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:31.270
When this card is used as an Overlay Unit together with another Gagaga Monster,

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:35.980
the Attack Power of one Xyz Monster on the opponent's field becomes zero!

00:19:37.980 --> 00:19:38.650
What?!

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:40.450
Cut it up, Hope!

00:19:40.900 --> 00:19:42.700
I'm gonna bring it to 'im!

00:19:43.240 --> 00:19:45.580
Attack Saimon, the Disciplinary High Priest!

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:48.040
Hope Sword Slash!

00:20:11.640 --> 00:20:14.270
Huh? What have I been doing up until now?

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:16.860
The brainwashing seems to have been lifted.

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:17.730
Yuma!

00:20:19.990 --> 00:20:22.700
I heard it from Shingetsu and rushed on over!

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:24.780
You're all right, Yuma-<i>kun</i>?

00:20:25.070 --> 00:20:26.660
I... think it's for the best.

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:28.290
Everyone...

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:29.870
I'm sorry!

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:32.870
I... I didn't mean to...

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:35.540
And I did all those horrible things to you guys!

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:39.670
Just forget about it.

00:20:40.840 --> 00:20:42.720
Yeah, don't worry.

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:47.930
If we stayed angry about such small things, you'd all be angry at me every single day, or not.

00:20:48.760 --> 00:20:51.770
So you're all going to forgive me?

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:53.190
Isn't that obvious?

00:20:54.390 --> 00:20:57.400
Because we're friends, right?

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:01.320
Friends, eh...?

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:04.110
<i>Thank you so much, everyone.</i>

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:05.530
<i>It's for the best!</i>

00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:07.030
<i>That was really cool!</i>

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:08.330
<i>It sure gave me a scare...</i>

00:21:09.330 --> 00:21:12.250
Yuma-<i>kun</i>..., you quit being Class Rep?

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:14.830
It's such a waste, after all the effort it took getting you elected.

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:16.830
It's all right.

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:20.300
Well, somehow that guy suits it much better than me.

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:24.930
Everyone! Take your seats, please!

00:21:29.010 --> 00:21:33.020
Shit. I guess the Student Council's of no more use to me...

00:21:33.020 --> 00:21:36.140
Guess I gotta go find a new hideout...

00:21:38.230 --> 00:21:38.810
Hmm?

00:21:44.280 --> 00:21:45.110
Wh-Who's there?

00:21:50.700 --> 00:21:51.240
Hey!

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:54.620
Who's the one who made this cool drawing?

00:21:56.370 --> 00:21:58.080
M-Me, but...

00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:01.130
I like you!

00:22:01.130 --> 00:22:03.590
You will be my henchman.

00:22:17.270 --> 00:22:24.150
<i>Does the thought "In any case..." following</i>

00:22:24.570 --> 00:22:31.830
<i>the foreboding premonition tell you to give up?</i>

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:39.420
<i>Do you laugh at your dreams, saying "impossible"?</i>

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:46.760
<i>You must find it funny that I'm not able to laugh at it, right?</i>

00:22:47.300 --> 00:23:03.690
<i>This song supports me, so I'll do my best for you this time.
 It's my turn to sing now.</i>

00:23:03.690 --> 00:23:08.490
<i>I will vow to you here</i>

00:23:08.490 --> 00:23:18.830
<i>As long as I live, you'll always be my tiny, little friend</i>

00:23:18.830 --> 00:23:27.380
<i>I'll erase all those little mistakes of yours</i>

00:23:27.380 --> 00:23:32.180
<i>Because I want to become an artist</i>

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:38.480
<i>Look, I like doing it 'cuz it's fun.</i>

00:23:40.350 --> 00:23:43.150
Shark's little sister suddenly goes missing from her hospital room.

00:23:43.150 --> 00:23:46.150
While looking for her along with Shark, another Barian henchman appears!

00:23:46.150 --> 00:23:48.610
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal II!

00:23:48.610 --> 00:23:51.490
"Shark's Rage!! Save The Captured Little Sister!"

00:23:51.490 --> 00:23:54.240
You're the only one who can protect your sister!
